    dialogAndEventActive:
    - dialog:
      - "No matter how many times I look at this city, it\u2019s such a mess. Don\u2019t
        you think so, Reva?"
      - Well, it suits Chrono perfectly.
      - By the way, Tempo, why did you decide to work for the government?
      - "Hmm... it\u2019s nothing big. There\u2019s just something I need the government\u2019s
        help with."
      - "I see... anyway, once this job\u2019s done, wanna go on a trip together?"
